      ":question/id": "d3b2949b-c25a-56dc-849d-38d738386862",
      ":question/problem": "At which points on the curve $x^{2} + 2 x y=30 - 11 y$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $(-6,5)$\n- **II.** $(-6,6)$\n- **III.** $(-3,6)$\n- **IV.** $(-5,5)$\n- **V.** $(-5,6)$\n- **VI.** $(5,5)$\n- **VII.** $(6,-6)$",
