      ":question/problem": "At which points on the curve $x^{2} + 2 x y=6 - 7 y$ is the tangent vector to the curve perpendicular to the vector $j$?\n\nSelect all that apply. If none apply, leave all boxes unchecked.\n\n- **I.** $(-6,1)$\n- **II.** $(-6,6)$\n- **III.** $(-3,6)$\n- **IV.** $(-1,1)$\n- **V.** $(-1,6)$\n- **VI.** $(1,1)$\n- **VII.** $(6,-6)$",
